  "programme": "Three linked concrete bowls (a 2.4 m kidney bowl, a 1.8 m clover bowl and a snake run) with steel coping, set into native prairie planting; curved timber terrace seating in a grass berm; a street-skating plaza with a stair set, handrail, hubba, ledges, flat rail, manual pad and bank; a gravel entrance spur and loop; benches, lights, bins, a bike rack and a drinking fountain; aspen and bur oak.",
  "design_basis": "Original concept after the catalogue skate park \"Naturalized Active\" references (variant 2): bowls and a snake run set into native planting with timber terraces. Depths and transitions are typical teaching values, not a skate-park design.",
