  "terrain_policy": "prepared_level",
  "native_scale_only": true,
  "limitations": [
    "Prepared level ground only. The bowls go 2.4 m below grade inside the park; drainage is not modelled.",
    "Bowl transitions are quarter circles from a flat bottom to vertical at the coping; real parks are designed and built by specialist firms.",
    "Skating surfaces are not walking routes: walkers use the deck, plaza, paths and grass.",
    "The complete assembly stays rigid when its parcel changes; use a larger parcel to rotate it."
  ],
